### PKCE Test Vectors
# code_verifier:  SISAZq5-y2aD41f_ule4SEYzZpprvjsuOIHRZ8Lu9qk
# code_challenge: Y831JcyYCF0Hnd-P_RNMU1r59o2cZhXX9K-b5jxza0k
# challenge = BASE64URL(SHA256(verifier))  — RFC 7636 S256

### Step 1: GET /authorize — user sees consent page
GET http://localhost:8080/authorize?client_id=test-client&response_type=code&redirect_uri=http://localhost:9000/callback&code_challenge=Y831JcyYCF0Hnd-P_RNMU1r59o2cZhXX9K-b5jxza0k&code_challenge_method=S256&state=abc&scope=mcp:read

### Step 2: POST /authorize — user clicks Allow, server issues auth code
# Copy the `code` value from the redirect Location header into Step 3.
# @no-redirect
POST http://localhost:8080/authorize
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=test-client&response_type=code&redirect_uri=http://localhost:9000/callback&code_challenge=Y831JcyYCF0Hnd-P_RNMU1r59o2cZhXX9K-b5jxza0k&code_challenge_method=S256&state=abc&scope=mcp:read&username=eren

### Step 3: POST /token — exchange code for tokens (paste code from Step 2)
POST http://localhost:8080/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code=74Qj3owck9AAyFhbKYLGGZ2niEYYMjDEWtsFbC590rw&redirect_uri=http://localhost:9000/callback&client_id=test-client&code_verifier=SISAZq5-y2aD41f_ule4SEYzZpprvjsuOIHRZ8Lu9qk

### Step 4: POST /token — refresh token rotation (paste refresh_token from Step 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token=5pyrI60-eOtDYZbVwzgEVDgkWzOUEOxCQ8TKS50Ew4k&client_id=test-client

### Step 5: POST /revoke — revoke refresh token (RFC 7009)
POST http://localhost:8080/revoke
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token=PASTE_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE&token_type_hint=refresh_token

### Step 6: POST /revoke — revoke access token (RFC 7009)
POST http://localhost:8080/revoke
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

token=z4ItyPnL_DTyHAckj1PKPbqXZCGGjQ3J5dMxzHcifGA&token_type_hint=access_token

### --- Error cases ---

### Wrong code_verifier — expect invalid_grant
POST http://localhost:8080/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code=PASTE_CODE_HERE&redirect_uri=http://localhost:9000/callback&client_id=test-client&code_verifier=wrongverifier

### Wrong grant_type — expect unsupported_grant_type
POST http://localhost:8080/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=foo&password=bar

### Missing parameters — expect invalid_request
POST http://localhost:8080/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=authorization_code&code=abc123